PIPD-LS-SP — licence position
==============================

NO LICENCE IS GRANTED FOR THIS REPOSITORY.

This is a deliberate, precise statement of the current position, not an oversight. It is split by
material class, because the two classes have different provenance.

1. CORPUS-DERIVED MATERIAL
   Text and structure derived from the governing PIPD source corpus (PIPD-LS-SP_藍圖.md,
   PIPD-LS-SP_PIPD-PKG-00..10, PIPD_LS_DOC-00..09, the donor Skill plugins, and the PIPD skeleton
   documents) is reproduced here for review. That corpus declares no licence over itself. All rights
   remain with their respective owners.

2. AGENT-AUTHORED ENGINEERING OUTPUT
   Code, schemas, tests and tooling authored inside this repository (src/, tests/, tools/, schemas/,
   fixtures/, dist/, docs/) was produced by the governed build described in PROVENANCE.md. No licence
   is granted for it either — the grant is an owner decision that has not been made.

STATUS: UNLICENSED REVIEW CANDIDATE. Absence of a licence means all rights reserved. Do not
redistribute, sublicense, or use commercially without an explicit owner decision.

SPDX (machine-readable): LicenseRef-PIPD-Proprietary
The owner can replace this in one action — see OWNER_LICENSE_DECISION.yaml.

